Dual-use content disclosure

This package includes Cloudflare's defensive security-audit agent skill. It can
guide source-code vulnerability review, security research, and locally scoped
penetration testing. The skill is included to help software owners identify,
validate, report, and remediate vulnerabilities in systems they are authorized
to assess.

The skill explicitly limits execution to authorized, isolated, local targets;
forbids probing production or third-party systems; requires safe fixtures and
sandbox controls; and separates unverified candidates from confirmed findings.
The package is not intended to deploy malware, obtain unauthorized access,
exfiltrate data, disrupt services, or evade security controls.
